\viewkind4\uc1\pard\li90\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. For the beauty of the earth,
\par For the beauty of the skies,
\par For the love which from our birth 
\par Over and around us lies,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Gracious God, to Thee we raise
\par This our sacrifice of praise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. for the beauty of each hour
\par Of the day and of the night,
\par Hill and vale, and tree and flower,
\par Sun and moon and stars of light:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Gracious God, to Thee we raise
\par This our sacrifice of praise.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. for the joy of ear and eye,  
\par For the heart and mind's delight,
\par For the mystic harmony
\par Linking sense to sound and sight:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Gracious God, to Thee we raise
\par This our sacrifice of praise.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. for the joy of human love,
\par Brother, sister, parent, child,
\par Friends on earth and friends above,
\par For all gentle thoughts and mild:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Gracious God, to Thee we raise
\par This our sacrifice of praise.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. for each perfect gift of Thine 
\par To our race so freely given
\par Graces human and divine
\par Flowers of earth and buds of heaven:
\par \pard 
\par \pard\li90\cf1\ul\b Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Gracious God, to Thee we raise
\par This our sacrifice of praise.
\par \pard\i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

